  qc: { asideLabel: "QC / 01—07", asideTitle: "A repeatable inspection order", asideText: "Start wide, then move closer. Hacoo’s return page requests specific evidence for different problem types, so photograph what identifies the order as well as the defect.", items: [["Confirm the ordered variant", "Match colour, size, version and quantity before judging any detail."], ["Check overall shape", "Look for distortion, asymmetry, uneven panels and proportions that disagree with the listing."], ["Inspect construction", "Zoom into seams, stitching, edges, fasteners and joins. Ask for another angle when an area is hidden."], ["Read labels and bag barcode", "For a size issue, official guidance asks for the size label, barcode on the product bag and an explanation of where fit is wrong."], ["Compare colour and measurements", "Lighting changes colour. Use listed measurements and a ruler photo for critical dimensions."], ["Record damage with context", "For breakage, photograph the outer package, product bag and damaged area before discarding packaging."], ["Classify the issue", "Wrong product, missing item, wrong parcel and description problems require different supporting images and order records."]], source: "Source checked: Hacoo Help Center return policy and return-process guidance · 28 August 2026." },
