  faq: [["Is this the official Hacoo website?", "No. Hacoo VIP is an independent research and discovery guide. It does not claim affiliation with Hacoo. Live product, payment and policy details must be checked on the destination page."], ["What is a Hacoo spreadsheet?", "It is a curated index that groups product discoveries, search terms and checking advice. It should shorten discovery time, but it cannot guarantee seller quality, inventory or delivery."], ["Are the prices fixed?", "No. USD figures are planning references. Product price, options, exchange rate, delivery and promotions can change on the live page."], ["How should I use QC photos?", "Compare the ordered variant and measurements first, then inspect overall shape, stitching, symmetry, labels, colour and visible damage. Ask for another image when a critical area is unclear."], ["Where does Hacoo deliver?", "The official help page states 28 supported countries but currently names 27: 22 in Europe plus the United States, Mexico, Canada, Brazil and Australia. Verify actual item and address availability in the app."], ["How long can delivery take?", "The Help Center gives a broad 15–28 day total reference. The website shipping page separately lists 15–25 days for the UK, France, Germany and Italy; 15–30 for Spain; and 25–65 for other countries. These are guidelines, not guarantees."], ["What should I know about returns?", "Official guidance says eligible return requests are generally made within 15 days after receipt. Some categories do not qualify for free return, exchanges are not currently offered, and evidence requirements differ by problem type."], ["What evidence can a return require?", "Depending on the issue, Hacoo may ask for the size label, product-bag barcode, outer package, shipping label, invoice, full product image and close-up of the defect or missing part."], ["Is Hacoo an online shop or a community platform?", "Hacoo’s current About Us and Terms describe a community-driven content-sharing and discovery ecosystem connecting users and independent creators. Its public pages also provide shipping and after-sales guidance. This site is an independent link index, not Hacoo."]],
